@urlBase = http://localhost:5037

### test for getting different config values
### when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT is changed
GET {{urlBase}}/api/settings
Accept: application/json


### get config values with IOptions
GET {{urlBase}}/api/application-info
Accept: application/json


### get config values from appsetting.yaml
